{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgShgDLbFJEVSt113FVdU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Your Friday in St. Louis (Oct 30)\n\n**Morning: The Griot Museum of Black History**\nIt's tucked in a quiet north-side neighborhood and has life-size wax figures of figures like Dred Scott, York, and Elizabeth Keckley. It's small, personal, and a world away from the Arch crowd. *Check hours before you go, since they're limited.*\n\n**Late morning: Drive through The Ville**\nThis is the historic Black neighborhood where you'll find **Sumner High**, the first Black high school west of the Mississippi. Chuck Berry, Tina Turner, Arthur Ashe, and Dick Gregory all went there. The old **Homer G. Phillips Hospital** building is nearby.\n\n**Lunch: Rib tips & snoots on the north side**\n- **Smoki O's** (N. Broadway): rib tips and snoots (crispy pig snout, a true St. Louis thing). It's a no-frills, sauce-on-everything, eat-in-the-car kind of spot. Go early, because they can close or sell out by late afternoon.\n- **Backup: C&K Barbecue** (Jennings) for snoot purists.\n\nGrab a bag of **Red Hot Riplets** (local chips) on the way.\n\n**Afternoon: Crate digging**\nHead to **Euclid Records** in Webster Groves and look for Maze's *Live in New Orleans*, which is essential cookout listening.\n\n**Evening: Comedy**\n- Check **Helium Comedy Club** (Brentwood) and **Funny Bone** (Westport) for Friday lineups. Halloween weekend often draws bigger names.\n- Look out for local Black comedy nights on Instagram too. This is Cedric the Entertainer's home turf, and the local scene has that Kings energy.\n\n**Late night: A grown-folks steppers set**\nSt. Louis has a serious steppin' scene, and Halloween Eve means costume parties. Search local steppers groups on Facebook or Eventbrite for Friday sets. If \"Before I Let Go\" doesn't close the night, you're at the wrong party.\n\n**After midnight:** a **slinger** at **Courtesy Diner** to soak it all up.\n\n---\n\nI can't verify live listings or hours, so confirm those the morning of. Want me to shift this toward a date night, a group outing, or something more low-key?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":647,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b193a38-66bc-46c5-8101-3df5168e3e87","uuid":"a457158e-9786-490b-a2a0-8a54ef90e756","timestamp":"2026-10-27T11:58:41.749Z","request_id":"req_011CgShgD6DNx69YjnSnW2Ub"}
